MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][256301] = {name = "[q4]Sanguine Feather Quill of Lana'thel", additional_info = "3.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nGilded Plume , Ancient Blood Pigment , Coagulated Miasma (50), Crimson Ink (30), Viridescent Ink (15), Expulsom (10)\n[q]Craft a Sanguine Feather Quill of Lana'thel.\nQuest:\nA Test of Quills\nZone:\nZuldazar\n\n[q4]Sanguine Feather Quill of Lana'thel\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\n[q2]Allows for the creation of Blood Contracts.\n[q2]Use: Siphons the blood of the dead around you, restoring your own health in the process.\n50\nRequiresKul Tiran Inscription\n(150)\n[q]\"It was never known if Lana'thel was the orignal designer of the quill, or merely the inspiration behind its design.\""}
